ted silhouettes, and metallic accents bring a sense of drama to evening ensembles. Pair sleek tailoring with bold accessories or delicate jewelry to create a look that is both refined and unforgettable.<\/p><h3><strong>The Art of Subtle Glamour<\/strong><\/h3><p>Luxury isn’t always about excess; it’s about intentionality. Soft cashmere knits, glossy leather boots, and perfectly cut dresses create a sense of understated elegance. Mix monochrome palettes with a single jewel-toned accent for a look that is quietly powerful yet unmistakably festive.<\/p>","text_column":"","grid_gap_desktop":20,"text_size":"body-fs-md"}}},"block_order":["paragraph_haAeiX"],"name":"t:rich_text.presets.rich_text.name","settings":{"section_id":"","section_padding_top_desktop":80,"section_padding_bottom_desktop":80,"section_padding_top_mobile":40,"section_padding_bottom_mobile":40,"invert_navigation_color":false,"color_scheme":"","section_bg_repeat":false,"section_bg_position":"bottom center","section_bg_size":"auto","section_bg_opacity":100,"column_width":10,"content_position":"center","content_alignment":"left","title_position":"inline","grid_gap_desktop":20}},"multicolumn_DAyJVW":{"type":"multicolumn","blocks":{"column_8xpHaD":{"type":"column","settings":{"title":"","text":"<p>Street style isn’t just what you wear—it’s how you wear your confidence.<\/p>","image":"","btn_label":"","btn_url":"","btn_style":"line"}},"column_k4ykTT":{"type":"column","settings":{"title":"","text":"<p>Mix, match, and break the rules; true style is fearless and unapologetic.<\/p>","image":"","btn_label":"","btn_url":"","btn_style":"line"}}},"block_order":["column_8xpHaD","column_k4ykTT"],"name":"t:multicolumn.presets.multicolumn.name","settings":{"section_id":"","section_padding_top_desktop":80,"section_padding_bottom_desktop":80,"section_padding_top_mobile":40,"section_padding_bottom_mobile":40,"invert_navigation_color":false,"color_scheme":"","section_width":"constrict","columns_alignment":"left","image_ratio"